{"vid":"yS9aK81xQSw","source":"yS9aK81xQSw.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Today, we are going to see the complete"},{"t":2.7,"txt":"day of an HSE officer. From leaving home"},{"t":5.9,"txt":"in the morning to returning from the"},{"t":7.6,"txt":"office in the evening, his"},{"t":9.2,"txt":"responsibilities keep changing every"},{"t":11.7,"txt":"hour."},{"t":12.6,"txt":"Every inspection, every meeting, and"},{"t":15,"txt":"every decision has only one objective."},{"t":17.9,"txt":"To send every worker back home safely."},{"t":21,"txt":"So, let's see how an HSE officer spends"},{"t":23.6,"txt":"his entire day according to the time."},{"t":26.2,"txt":"Now, it's 6:00 a.m. The HSE officer"},{"t":29.5,"txt":"begins his day."},{"t":31.2,"txt":"First, he checks the weather forecast"},{"t":33.2,"txt":"and reviews the activities planned for"},{"t":35,"txt":"the site today."},{"t":36.4,"txt":"Looking at the high-risk jobs,"},{"t":38.3,"txt":"he mentally plans his entire day."},{"t":41.5,"txt":"Now, it's 6:30 a.m."},{"t":44,"txt":"The HSE officer leaves for the site"},{"t":46.4,"txt":"carrying his safety helmet, safety"},{"t":48.4,"txt":"shoes, reflective vest, and the"},{"t":50.3,"txt":"necessary documents."},{"t":52.2,"txt":"On the way, he keeps checking project"},{"t":54.3,"txt":"updates and messages from the"},{"t":55.7,"txt":"supervisors."},{"t":57.3,"txt":"Now, it's 7:00 a.m."},{"t":59.4,"txt":"The HSE officer has arrived at the site."},{"t":62.4,"txt":"After completing the attendance, he"},{"t":64.2,"txt":"immediately starts the site inspection."},{"t":66.8,"txt":"The entry gate, emergency exits, fire"},{"t":69.3,"txt":"extinguishers, and housekeeping are"},{"t":70.9,"txt":"checked."},{"t":72.2,"txt":"Now, it's 7:30 a.m."},{"t":74.6,"txt":"Workers have gradually started arriving"},{"t":76.7,"txt":"at the site."},{"t":77.8,"txt":"Along with the supervisors, the HSE"},{"t":79.9,"txt":"officer discusses today's work locations"},{"t":82.2,"txt":"and high-risk activities."},{"t":84.2,"txt":"At the same time, he ensures that all"},{"t":86.2,"txt":"work areas are ready for work to begin."},{"t":88.7,"txt":"Now, it's 8:00 a.m. All the workers have"},{"t":91.7,"txt":"gathered at the assembly point. The HSE"},{"t":94.4,"txt":"officer conducts the daily toolbox talk."},{"t":97.1,"txt":"Workers are briefed about today's work,"},{"t":99.3,"txt":"hazards, and safety precautions."},{"t":101.8,"txt":"Now, it's 8:30 a.m."},{"t":104.4,"txt":"After the toolbox talk, the HSE officer"},{"t":107,"txt":"inspects the workers' PPE. Helmets,"},{"t":110,"txt":"safety shoes, gloves, safety glasses,"},{"t":112.8,"txt":"and reflective vests must all be in"},{"t":115,"txt":"proper condition. Anyone who does not"},{"t":117.4,"txt":"have proper PPE is asked to replace it"},{"t":119.8,"txt":"first."},{"t":121,"txt":"Now, it's 9:00 a.m. High risk activities"},{"t":124.2,"txt":"are about to begin. The HSE officer"},{"t":126.6,"txt":"verifies the work permits. Work is"},{"t":128.9,"txt":"permitted only after checking the risk"},{"t":130.8,"txt":"assessment, JSA, and the required"},{"t":133.1,"txt":"approvals."},{"t":134.5,"txt":"Now, it's 9:30 a.m. Work has officially"},{"t":137.9,"txt":"started on the site. The HSE officer"},{"t":140.4,"txt":"makes rounds of different work areas. He"},{"t":142.9,"txt":"closely monitors work at height,"},{"t":144.8,"txt":"excavation, crane lifting, and"},{"t":146.8,"txt":"electrical work."},{"t":148.3,"txt":"Now, it's 10:00 a.m."},{"t":150.3,"txt":"The routine safety inspection is in"},{"t":152.1,"txt":"progress. If any unsafe act or unsafe"},{"t":155.2,"txt":"condition is noticed, it is immediately"},{"t":157.6,"txt":"rectified. Safety observations are also"},{"t":160.4,"txt":"recorded at this time."},{"t":162.6,"txt":"Now, it's 10:30 a.m."},{"t":165,"txt":"The HSE officer coordinates with"},{"t":167,"txt":"contractors and supervisors. While"},{"t":169.3,"txt":"reviewing the work progress, he ensures"},{"t":171.4,"txt":"that all activities are being carried"},{"t":173.3,"txt":"out according to the approved safety"},{"t":175,"txt":"procedures."},{"t":176.8,"txt":"Now, it's 11:00 a.m."},{"t":178.8,"txt":"If crane lifting or any other critical"},{"t":180.9,"txt":"activity is in progress on the site, the"},{"t":183,"txt":"HSE officer closely monitors that"},{"t":185.2,"txt":"activity."},{"t":186.3,"txt":"Barricading, the exclusion zone, and the"},{"t":188.5,"txt":"communication system are verified."},{"t":191.3,"txt":"Now, it's 11:30 a.m."},{"t":193.7,"txt":"The HSE officer records the inspection"},{"t":196,"txt":"findings and assigns corrective actions"},{"t":197.9,"txt":"wherever required."},{"t":199.4,"txt":"Workers who follow safe working"},{"t":201,"txt":"practices are also appreciated. Now,"},{"t":203.9,"txt":"it's 12:00 p.m."},{"t":205.7,"txt":"During this time, if any near miss or"},{"t":208.2,"txt":"minor incident is reported, the HSE"},{"t":210.8,"txt":"officer immediately reaches the incident"},{"t":213.1,"txt":"location. He conducts the investigation,"},{"t":215.8,"txt":"identifies the root cause, and provides"},{"t":218.2,"txt":"recommendations for future prevention."},{"t":221.5,"txt":"Now, it's 12:30 p.m."},{"t":224.3,"txt":"Before the lunch break begins, the HSE"},{"t":226.7,"txt":"officer ensures that all high risk"},{"t":229,"txt":"activities have been and paused and that"},{"t":231.6,"txt":"the work areas are in a secure"},{"t":233.3,"txt":"condition."},{"t":235.3,"txt":"Now, it's 1:00 p.m."},{"t":237.6,"txt":"The workers are having lunch. The HSE"},{"t":239.9,"txt":"officer also takes his lunch break."},{"t":242.3,"txt":"However, during this time, he continues"},{"t":244.7,"txt":"updating inspection reports, checking"},{"t":246.8,"txt":"emails, and planning the afternoon"},{"t":248.8,"txt":"activities."},{"t":250.9,"txt":"Now, it's 1:30 p.m."},{"t":253.6,"txt":"After the lunch break, the HSE officer"},{"t":255.8,"txt":"visits the site again and ensures that"},{"t":258.2,"txt":"all workers are safely restarting their"},{"t":260.4,"txt":"work."},{"t":261.5,"txt":"Now, it's 2:00 p.m."},{"t":263.6,"txt":"The afternoon safety round begins."},{"t":266.3,"txt":"During this time, special attention is"},{"t":268.4,"txt":"given to heat stress, drinking water,"},{"t":271,"txt":"worker fatigue, and housekeeping."},{"t":273.5,"txt":"Now, it's 3:30 p.m."},{"t":276,"txt":"The HSE officer coordinates with"},{"t":278,"txt":"different departments on the site and"},{"t":279.8,"txt":"verifies that the permits are still"},{"t":281.5,"txt":"valid and that the safety controls are"},{"t":283.4,"txt":"being followed effectively."},{"t":285.2,"txt":"Now, it's 3:00 p.m."},{"t":287.4,"txt":"If new workers have joined the site, a"},{"t":289.4,"txt":"safety induction is conducted for them."},{"t":291.8,"txt":"They are informed about emergency"},{"t":293.2,"txt":"procedures, site rules, and PPE"},{"t":295.8,"txt":"requirements."},{"t":297.2,"txt":"Now, it's 3:30 p.m."},{"t":299.6,"txt":"The HSE officer updates the safety"},{"t":301.7,"txt":"observations and inspection records."},{"t":304.2,"txt":"Follow-up on pending corrective actions"},{"t":306,"txt":"is also carried out during this time."},{"t":308.3,"txt":"Now, it's 4:00 p.m."},{"t":310.4,"txt":"A safety meeting is held with the"},{"t":311.8,"txt":"supervisors and project management. The"},{"t":314.4,"txt":"day's observations, near misses, and the"},{"t":316.9,"txt":"next day's high-risk activities are"},{"t":318.8,"txt":"discussed."},{"t":320.4,"txt":"Now, it's 4:30 p.m."},{"t":322.8,"txt":"The work is gradually coming to an end."},{"t":325.3,"txt":"The HSE officer ensures that the work"},{"t":327.3,"txt":"areas are clean, the waste has been"},{"t":329.2,"txt":"properly disposed of, and unnecessary"},{"t":331.4,"txt":"hazards have been removed."},{"t":333.9,"txt":"Now, it's 5:00 p.m."},{"t":335.9,"txt":"It is time for the final site"},{"t":337.5,"txt":"inspection."},{"t":338.6,"txt":"Electrical isolation is verified,"},{"t":340.8,"txt":"excavations are secured, open permits"},{"t":343.3,"txt":"are closed, and it is checked whether"},{"t":345.1,"txt":"the equipment has been parked safely."},{"t":348,"txt":"Now, it's 5:30 p.m."},{"t":350.4,"txt":"The HSE officer returns to the office"},{"t":352.4,"txt":"and prepares the daily HSE report."},{"t":355.2,"txt":"Today's inspections, permits, incidents,"},{"t":357.9,"txt":"trainings, and corrective actions are"},{"t":359.8,"txt":"updated in the records."},{"t":362,"txt":"Now, it's 6:00 p.m. in the evening."},{"t":364.7,"txt":"The responsibilities of the entire day"},{"t":366.5,"txt":"have been completed. The HSE officer"},{"t":368.8,"txt":"submits the final reports and reviews"},{"t":370.8,"txt":"the next day's work schedule."},{"t":373.2,"txt":"Another working day comes to an end."},{"t":376,"txt":"And the most important thing,"},{"t":378,"txt":"today as well, all the workers have"},{"t":380,"txt":"returned home safely."},{"t":381.7,"txt":">> This is the daily routine of an HSE"},{"t":384.6,"txt":"officer."},{"t":385.6,"txt":"From the morning planning to the evening"},{"t":387.5,"txt":"reporting, his entire day revolves"},{"t":390.2,"txt":"around just one objective, to prevent"},{"t":393.1,"txt":"accidents and send every worker home"},{"t":395.4,"txt":"safely."},{"t":396.7,"txt":"That is why HSE is not just a job, it is"},{"t":400,"txt":"a responsibility."},{"t":401.9,"txt":"If you like this video, then be sure to"},{"t":403.8,"txt":"subscribe to the HSE Coach. And for HSE"},{"t":407,"txt":"study materials, interview questions,"},{"t":409.1,"txt":"and practical safety knowledge, visit"},{"t":411.1,"txt":"www.thehsecoach.com."},{"t":414.7,"txt":"See you in the next video. Until then,"},{"t":416.9,"txt":"stay safe, work safe."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"Today,"},{"t":0.92,"w":"we"},{"t":1.16,"w":"are"},{"t":1.28,"w":"going"},{"t":1.52,"w":"to"},{"t":1.64,"w":"see"},{"t":1.84,"w":"the"},{"t":2,"w":"complete"},{"t":2.68,"w"